    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zerra's Adventure is a classic turn-based RPG with no random encounters. Explore diverse areas, collect items and treasures to improve your team and defeat the strangest enemies. Level up, learn new attacks, and meet quirky characters on your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/03e892842c1f02f032cf916c9685381e.webp?t=1753315431\" width=163 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore diverse landscapes</strong>, from frog-filled forests to infernal deserts and dark caves infested with spiders. Face dangers like spikes, fireballs, and shots as you search for treasures, weapons, and other items that will aid you in your adventure, even in a gym filled with insane bodybuilders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/dcf5af058d07dc5cb3b33113371d9ce2.webp?t=1753315431\" width=131 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Confront a wide variety of enemies</strong>, from small turtles and pigs to armed rabbits and final bosses such as giant frogs and penguins. Utilize your skill and strategy to overcome their signature attacks and progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/6f2f93de6edf0dce0abf861e4c3e91e1.webp?t=1753315431\" width=180 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Solve simple and classic genre puzzles</strong> during your adventure and find secret bonuses that will challenge you with short minigames that reward your skill with special and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/67ed2bf28c69cd8c161252e32c564e2c.webp?t=1753315431\" width=167 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/4362307f3e211dcfd2d5cd78e2ed0df1.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/4362307f3e211dcfd2d5cd78e2ed0df1.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/4362307f3e211dcfd2d5cd78e2ed0df1.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Improve your party</strong> by gaining experience and leveling up. Discover new attacks and passive abilities that offer different benefits to the team. Customize each character with weapons and accessories found during your adventure, choosing between increasing attack, defense, or special abilities according to your gameplay style. The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/3cd4f9097674aecb43dfc25c9fc21e41.webp?t=1753315431\" width=237 height=29 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strategic <strong>turn-based battles</strong> with no random encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six playable characters, each with their own <strong>unique attacks, skill tree and personalities!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny of the 5 dungeons to <strong>discover treasure, secret areas</strong> and <strong>meet quirky characters</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy simple puzzles and minigames that offer <strong>tasty rewards</strong> to enhance your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your team</strong> using the &quot;Accessory System&quot;: focus on attack, defense, healing, special abilities, or hundreds of other options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and sweet:</strong> designed to complete the main story in under 10 hours, respecting your valuable time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming, original</strong> <strong>Pixel Art</strong> inspired by the 8-bit and 16-bit era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>energetic, personality-filled</strong> original soundtrack to accompany your adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/72e66a4d309053e3290d8ff342f97c40.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/72e66a4d309053e3290d8ff342f97c40.apng?t=1753315431\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=114 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zerra's Adventure is a classic turn-based RPG with no random encounters. Explore diverse areas, collect items and treasures to improve your team and defeat the strangest enemies. Level up, learn new attacks, and meet quirky characters on your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/03e892842c1f02f032cf916c9685381e.webp?t=1753315431\" width=163 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/252e28b4ae4c0ff65a2f2e2170bf293c.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Explore diverse landscapes</strong>, from frog-filled forests to infernal deserts and dark caves infested with spiders. Face dangers like spikes, fireballs, and shots as you search for treasures, weapons, and other items that will aid you in your adventure, even in a gym filled with insane bodybuilders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/dcf5af058d07dc5cb3b33113371d9ce2.webp?t=1753315431\" width=131 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/48eae8557409ac2ca9c00bf6e563390b.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Confront a wide variety of enemies</strong>, from small turtles and pigs to armed rabbits and final bosses such as giant frogs and penguins. Utilize your skill and strategy to overcome their signature attacks and progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/6f2f93de6edf0dce0abf861e4c3e91e1.webp?t=1753315431\" width=180 height=29 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.webm?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/21b0494865266a43bcda2bf037165bda.mp4?t=1753315431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Solve simple and classic genre puzzles</strong> during your adventure and find secret bonuses that will challenge you with short minigames that reward your skill with special and unique items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src