mple puzzles and minigames that offer <strong>tasty rewards</strong> to enhance your party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your team</strong> using the &quot;Accessory System&quot;: focus on attack, defense, healing, special abilities, or hundreds of other options!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and sweet:</strong> designed to complete the main story in under 10 hours, respecting your valuable time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming, original</strong> <strong>Pixel Art</strong> inspired by the 8-bit and 16-bit era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>energetic, personality-filled</strong> original soundtrack to accompany your adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/72e66a4d309053e3290d8ff342f97c40.poster.avif?t=1753315431\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779580/extras/72e66a4d309053e3290d8ff342f97c40.apng?t=1753315431\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=114 /></picture></span></p>",
